versions of
pre-3.14 kernels are not still running by then.

> +#define EXT4_EXTRA_NEGATIVE_DATE_CUTOFF 6 * (1UL << 32)

That would make this (5 * (1ULL << 32)).  I think this should be ULL so =
that
if there are 64-bit timestamps on 32-bit systems it will still work =
correctly.

